{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"gravewing","model_identifier":"gravewing","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# gravewing\n\nGravewing (C1), high flyer, 2.5 m wingspan (88 u), stands 0.9 m (31 u) on the ground.\n\nAn undead carrion crow: ragged black feathers falling out to show bone (wing bone, tail bones, bare rib patch on the flank, bare skull patches), a long hooked beak, ragged primaries and green eye lights. Bird rig: root > body > neck > head > jaw, tail, wing_* > wing_mid_* > wing_tip_*, leg_* > foot_*, and slot_carry between the feet.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -44.0..44.0, y 0.0..29.5, z -25.0..22.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- in flight: one box 30 x 12 x 44 (w x h x d) around the body (wings excluded), centred on the body; on the ground: 14 x 31 x 30\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop | perched on the ground, wings folded |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.5 | loop |  |\n| `fly` | 0.9 | loop | flapping flight (loop), legs tucked |\n| `circle` | 2.4 | loop | banked glide (loop) |\n| `swoop` | 1.3 | once | key 0.7 s: talons strike at the bottom of the dive (dive 0.35, talons thrust 0.62, clamp 0.7, climb) |\n| `snatch` | 1.6 | once | key 0.45 s: talons close on the human; it is then carried at slot_carry while labouring flaps lift it (ends in the carry pose) |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | wings raised, beak gaping (ground) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once |  |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | crumples onto its side, one wing splayed; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.2 | loop | flapping and writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 28.4 u/s (0.80 m/s), cycle 0.8 s, 22.8 u per cycle (strutting walk on the ground)\n- `run`: 88.9 u/s (2.50 m/s), cycle 0.5 s, 44.4 u per cycle (flapping hop on the ground)\n- `fly`: flap 0.9 s per beat; designed for about 8 m/s (285 u/s) cruise\n- `circle`: banked glide, 2.4 s loop, for circling high above the target\n\n## Key times\n\n- `swoop`: key 0.7 s: talons strike at the bottom of the dive (dive 0.35, talons thrust 0.62, clamp 0.7, climb)\n- `snatch`: key 0.45 s: talons close on the human; it is then carried at slot_carry while labouring flaps lift it (ends in the carry pose)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_carry` on `body` at (0, 0.5, -1)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Fly clips lift the body pivot 6.0 u so the hanging parts stay above the model origin; the game sets the real altitude (about 4 m and up).\n- slot_carry: carried human hips attach there (under the body, between the feet).\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye cubes.\n"},"description":"# gravewing\n\nGravewing (C1), high flyer, 2.5 m wingspan (88 u), stands 0.9 m (31 u) on the ground.\n\nAn undead carrion crow: ragged black feathers falling out to show bone (wing bone, tail bones, bare rib patch on the flank, bare skull patches), a long hooked beak, ragged primaries and green eye lights. Bird rig: root > body > neck > head > jaw, tail, wing_* > wing_mid_* > wing_tip_*, leg_* > foot_*, and slot_carry between the feet.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -44.0..44.0, y 0.0..29.5, z -25.0..22.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- in flight: one box 30 x 12 x 44 (w x h x d) around the body (wings excluded), centred on the body; on the ground: 14 x 31 x 30\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop | perched on the ground, wings folded |\n| `walk` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.5 | loop |  |\n| `fly` | 0.9 | loop | flapping flight (loop), legs tucked |\n| `circle` | 2.4 | loop | banked glide (loop) |\n| `swoop` | 1.3 | once | key 0.7 s: talons strike at the bottom of the dive (dive 0.35, talons thrust 0.62, clamp 0.7, climb) |\n| `snatch` | 1.6 | once | key 0.45 s: talons close on the human; it is then carried at slot_carry while labouring flaps lift it (ends in the carry pose) |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | wings raised, beak gaping (ground) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once |  |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | crumples onto its side, one wing splayed; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.2 | loop | flapping and writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 28.4 u/s (0.80 m/s), cycle 0.8 s, 22.8 u per cycle (strutting walk on the ground)\n- `run`: 88.9 u/s (2.50 m/s), cycle 0.5 s, 44.4 u per cycle (flapping hop on the ground)\n- `fly`: flap 0.9 s per beat; designed for about 8 m/s (285 u/s) cruise\n- `circle`: banked glide, 2.4 s loop, for circling high above the target\n\n## Key times\n\n- `swoop`: key 0.7 s: talons strike at the bottom of the dive (dive 0.35, talons thrust 0.62, clamp 0.7, climb)\n- `snatch`: key 0.45 s: talons close on the human; it is then carried at slot_carry while labouring flaps lift it (ends in the carry pose)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_carry` on `body` at (0, 0.5, -1)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Fly clips lift the body pivot 6.0 u so the hanging parts stay above the model origin; the game sets the real altitude (about 4 m and up).\n- slot_carry: carried human hips attach there (under the body, between the feet).\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye cubes.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.0,12.0,-9.0],"to":[5.0,22.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,17.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[64,14,74.0,24.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[40,14,52.0,24.0],"texture":0},"south"